  (5) Any of the following persons shall be subject to an administrative fine not exceeding five million won: <Amended on Mar. 31, 2020; May 18, 2021>
  1. A person who violates Article 15(1), 16(1), 17(1) or (3), or 18(1) or (3), the main clause of Article 19(1), the main clause of Article 22(1), Article 24(1) or (4), 25(1), 26, or 29(1) or (2) (including cases applicable mutatis mutandis in Article 166-2), Article 31(1) or 32(1) (only applicable to subparagraphs 1 through 4), Article 37(1), 44(2), 49(2), 50(3), 62(1), 66, 68(1), 75(6), 77(2), 90(1), 94(2), 122(2), or 124(1) (excluding submission of evidentiary data), and Article 125(7), 132(2), 137(3), or 145(1);
